          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Description",
            "icon": "star",
            "content": "<p>Curated by professional instructors, the Ocean Explorer Adventure Kit equips you with everything needed to explore the underwater world effortlessly. </p><p>Perfect for beginners and seasoned swimmers alike, this kit ensures a seamless and enjoyable aquatic experience.</p><p>What's Included:</p><p><strong>Obsidian Mask</strong>: Enjoy crystal-clear vision with a single-lens prescription mask. The comfortable silicone skirt and wide field of view provide a secure fit and expansive underwater scenery.</p><p><strong>Power Fins</strong>: Lightweight and easy to use, these fins feature a unique ridge design for effortless turning and a low surface area shell to reduce fatigue, ideal for enhancing your swim technique.</p><p><strong>Classic Snorkel</strong>: Breathe freely with our simple, durable snorkel design, ensuring uninterrupted airflow during your underwater explorations.</p><p><strong>Soft Microfiber Towe</strong>l: Quick-drying and gentle on the skin, perfect for post-swim comfort.</p><p><strong>2L Waterproof Dry Bag</strong>: Protect your essentials with a sturdy, waterproof bag featuring touch screen phone access for convenience on the go.</p><p><strong>Mask Case</strong>: Safeguard your prescription mask from scratches and damage with the included zip-up case.</p><p><strong>Bonus</strong>: Receive a digital copy of \"A Guide to Aquatic Adventures\" by Ocean Optics, packed with tips on snorkeling, marine life, and ocean conservation.</p><p>Start Your Underwater Journey Today!</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
