          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>This Single Vision<strong> Prescription Dive Mask </strong>is designed for divers and snorkellers seeking enhanced underwater clarity. Featuring corrective lenses tailored to nearsighted vision, this sleek black mask ensures both style and functionality. The soft silicone skirt offers a secure, comfortable fit for medium face shapes, while the broad peripheral view keeps the underwater world fully in sight. With easy-release buckles and a soft nose pocket for effortless equalizing, it's perfect for both casual snorkeling and deep dives.</p><p>Ideal for aquatic explorers needing vision correction, the Obsidian delivers comfort, style, and improved sight below the surface.</p>"
          }
        }
